{
  "title": "Update EU database of processing factors",
  "authors": [
    {
      "name": "European Food Safety Authority"
    }
  ],
  "publication_date": "2022-09",
  "abstract": "This document presents an update of the European Union (EU) database of processing factors, which are used to estimate pesticide residues in processed commodities.",
  "content": [
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "The EU database of processing factors is a critical tool for estimating pesticide residues in processed commodities. This document presents an update of the database, which includes new studies and improved data quality."
    },
    {
      "section": "Methodology",
      "text": "The methodology used to update the database included the evaluation of new studies, improvement of data quality, and alignment with OECD guidelines."
    },
    {
      "section": "Results",
      "text": "The updated database includes 123 new processing factors, bringing the total number of factors to 1,433. The database also includes improved data quality, including more detailed information on study design and analytical methods."
    },
    {
      "section": "Discussion",
      "text": "The update of the database has improved the accuracy and reliability of pesticide residue estimates in processed commodities. However, there are still limitations and challenges associated with the use of processing factors, including variability in study results and limited availability of data for certain commodities."
    },
    {
      "section": "Recommendations",
      "text": [
        {
          "recommendation": "Establish a mechanism for regular updates of the EU database of processing factors.",
          "rationale": "New studies are conducted and submitted continuously, and residue definitions keep changing."
        },
        {
          "recommendation": "Align raw commodity categories used with respect to storage stability and analytical methods.",
          "rationale": "This should be kept in mind when updating the respective OECD guideline and guidance document."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "references": [
    {
      "title": "ESA (online)",
      "author": "",
      "year": ""
    },
    {
      "title": "BNN (2012)",
      "author": "",
      "year": ""
    }
  ]
}
